From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Seer: metadata screen, blue accent, Seer look kept on Seer screens, player button

Seer screens always use the Seer look, whatever theme is picked elsewhere; the accent is blue
(statuses stay green); the player play button is a plain round control; the metadata
report gets its own admin screen (entry on the Seer page) with the five problem lists.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
